# WinZip

> WinZip is the world's leading file compression, encryption, and sharing software, trusted by millions of home users and enterprises to manage, protect, and move files.

WinZip supports Windows and Mac, with companion mobile apps for iOS and Android. Products range from individual desktop tools to enterprise-wide deployment with centralized management and security policy controls.

## Products

- [WinZip for Windows](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/winzip/): The flagship zip and file management tool. Compress, encrypt, share, and back up files. Supports Zip, Zipx, 7Z, RAR, and more.
- [WinZip Suite](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/winzip/suite/): WinZip bundled with additional productivity tools for file management and system optimization.
- [WinZip for Mac](https://www.winzip.com/mac/en/): Native Mac compression and archiving tool with Zip, ZIPX, RAR, 7-Zip, and Tar support.
- [WinZip Enterprise](https://www.winzip.com/en/enterprise/): Enterprise-grade deployment with admin controls, compliance features, and centralized licensing. Supports FIPS 140-2 and AES-256 encryption.
- [WinZip PDF Pro](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/pdf-pro/): PDF creation, conversion, editing, compression, and protection.
- [WinZip Courier](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/courier/): Secure file sharing via email with compression and encryption built in.
- [WinZip SafeMedia](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/safemedia/): Secure transfer of files to removable media with encryption and tracking.
- [WinZip System Utilities Suite](https://www.winzip.com/en/product/system-utilities/): PC optimization, cleanup, and performance tools.

## Key Capabilities

- File compression and decompression (Zip, Zipx, 7Z, RAR, TAR, GZip, VHD, XZ, and more)
- AES-256 military-grade encryption and password protection
- Direct sharing to email, cloud services (Dropbox, Google Drive, OneDrive, SharePoint)
- PDF tools: convert, compress, edit, and protect PDF files
- Image, video, and audio compression
- Zip file repair
- Enterprise: FIPS 140-2 compliance, group policy management, silent deployment

